OL,3,GNEWSA'Devoted mother' died from
OL,4,Aheatstroke climbing Wales' highest
OL,5,Amountain
OL,6,
OL,7,FA mother who was celebrating her
OL,8,Fbirthday by climbing Wales' highest
OL,9,Fmountain developed heat stroke and
OL,10,Fdied, an inquest has found.
OL,12,FSophie Goodyer-Bird, from Birmingham,
OL,13,Ftravelled to Eryri National Park in
OL,14,FJuly a few days after her 35th
OL,15,Fbirthday.
OL,17,FThe hearing in Caernarfon was told the
OL,18,Fmother-of-one found the climb more
OL,19,Fchallenging than she had expected, but
OL,20,Fmanaged to reach the summit of Yr
OL,21,FWyddfa - also known as Snowdon - with a
OL,22,Ffriend.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
